# Architecture enforcement files require human review.
# GitHub only reads CODEOWNERS from the repo root, docs/, or .github/. After copying this
# starter into its own repo, move this file to .github/CODEOWNERS, replace @your-org/architects,
# and enable "Require review from Code Owners" in the branch protection rule for main.
#
# Paths below assume the starter IS the repo root. If it stays nested (as in jonathanhudak/tools),
# prefix each path with /starters/hexagonal-cdk.

/eslint.config.js                 @your-org/architects
/.dependency-cruiser.cjs          @your-org/architects
/tsconfig*.json                   @your-org/architects
/packages/*/tsconfig*.json        @your-org/architects
/infra/tsconfig.json              @your-org/architects
/packages/*/package.json          @your-org/architects
/pnpm-workspace.yaml              @your-org/architects
/.npmrc                           @your-org/architects
/vitest.config.ts                 @your-org/architects
/arch/                            @your-org/architects
/canary/                          @your-org/architects
/scripts/                         @your-org/architects
/.claude/                         @your-org/architects
/.github/workflows/               @your-org/architects
/.github/CODEOWNERS               @your-org/architects
/AGENTS.md                        @your-org/architects
/CLAUDE.md                        @your-org/architects
